{
  "_name": "全日房默认模板",
  "_description": "全日房（goodsType=1）标准模板：预付、入住当天18:00前免费取消、无早餐、无连住限制、11%佣金。",
  "_goodsType": 1,

  "_HOWTO": [
    "本文件是完整的 batchCreateGoods 请求参数，poiId/partnerId/roomId/roomName 需在执行时覆盖。",
    "模板中 __TODAY__ 和 __TWO_YEARS_LATER__ 为占位符，由脚本在运行时替换为真实日期。",
    "",
    "【取消规则】rpCancelModel 结构：",
    "  normalRule = 平日取消政策，weekendRule = 周末（周六日）取消政策",
    "  - 不区分平日/周末：weekendRule 传 null",
    "  - 平日不可取消+周末免费取消：",
    "      normalRule: {cancelItemType:0}",
    "      weekendRule: {cancelItemType:1, moveUpCancelDays:0, moveUpCancelHour:'18:00:00'}",
    "",
    "【早餐规则】rpBreakFastModel 结构：",
    "  normalRule = 平日早餐份数，weekendRule = 周末（周六日）早餐份数",
    "  - 不区分平日/周末：weekendRule 传 null",
    "  - 平日单早+周末双早：",
    "      normalRule: {num:1}",
    "      weekendRule: {num:2}",
    "",
    "【--set 常用示例】",
    "  平日/周末同取消政策（免费取消）：",
    "    --set goodsDetailList.0.rpInfo.rpCancelModel.normalRule.cancelItemType=1",
    "    --set goodsDetailList.0.rpInfo.rpCancelModel.normalRule.moveUpCancelDays=0",
    "    --set goodsDetailList.0.rpInfo.rpCancelModel.normalRule.moveUpCancelHour=23:59:00",
    "",
    "  平日不可取消 + 周末入住前18:00免费取消：",
    "    --set goodsDetailList.0.rpInfo.rpCancelModel.normalRule.cancelItemType=0",
    "    --set 'goodsDetailList.0.rpInfo.rpCancelModel.weekendRule={\"cancelItemType\":1,\"moveUpCancelDays\":0,\"moveUpCancelHour\":\"18:00:00\"}'",
    "",
    "  平日当天23:59前免费取消 + 周末不可取消：",
    "    --set goodsDetailList.0.rpInfo.rpCancelModel.normalRule.cancelItemType=1",
    "    --set goodsDetailList.0.rpInfo.rpCancelModel.normalRule.moveUpCancelDays=0",
    "    --set goodsDetailList.0.rpInfo.rpCancelModel.normalRule.moveUpCancelHour=23:59:00",
    "    --set 'goodsDetailList.0.rpInfo.rpCancelModel.weekendRule={\"cancelItemType\":0}'",
    "",
    "  含单早（平日/周末相同）：",
    "    --set goodsDetailList.0.rpInfo.rpBreakFastModel.normalRule.num=1",
    "",
    "  平日单早 + 周末双早：",
    "    --set goodsDetailList.0.rpInfo.rpBreakFastModel.normalRule.num=1",
    "    --set 'goodsDetailList.0.rpInfo.rpBreakFastModel.weekendRule={\"effectiveTimes\":null,\"num\":2}'",
    "",
    "  修改售价（单位：分，200元=20000）：",
    "    --set goodsDetailList.0.priceInfo.unifiedDatePriceInfos.weekPriceInfos.0.priceInfo.salePrice=20000"
  ],

